[32m*Key observations*:  
[0m
[32m* The World Bank’s **Digital‑in‑Health** flagship stresses that **tele‑maternal care projects must demonstrate reliable electricity, mobile‑phone and internet connectivity**, and can **leverage existing software** ([source 4](https://documents1.worldbank.org/curated/en/099012224124520218/txt/P17507508ad9870a0096a7062619a4ba90a.pdf)).  
[0m
[32m* The **Pandemic Fund** requires an invitation, but the **guidance note** and **scoring methodology** are publicly posted, allowing Fundación Salud Rural to **prepare a pre‑proposal** and request an invitation via the **Technical Advisory Panel** ([source 5](https://www.thepandemicfund.org/call-for-proposals)).  

